@startuml sequence_communication
!theme plain
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 250

title Service Communication Flow\n(Exchanges, Queues, and Routing Keys)

participant "Client\n(FastAPI Bridge\nor Service A)" as Client
participant "RabbitMQ Broker" as Broker
participant "ServiceRegistry" as Registry
participant "MyService\n(ServiceBase)" as Service

== Phase 1: Service Registration ==

note over Service
  On startup, service discovers
  its svc_api_* methods and builds
  _SERVICE_INFO dict automatically
end note

Service -> Broker : **publish** to exchange\n**""service_information""** (topic)\nrouting_key = ""service.information""\nbody = { info: _SERVICE_INFO, state: ""on"" }

note over Broker #fff3e0
  Exchange: **service_information** (topic)
  Queue: **service_infor_queue** (durable)
  Binding: routing_key = ""service.information""
end note

Broker -> Registry : deliver to **service_infor_queue**

Registry -> Registry : handle_update()\nStore service in\nservices_information dict

== Phase 2: Registry Broadcasts Update to All Subscribers ==

Registry -> Broker : **publish** to exchange\n**""services_update""** (fanout)\nrouting_key = """"\nbody = { all services info }

note over Broker #e0f7fa
  Exchange: **services_update** (fanout)
  Queues: exclusive auto-delete per subscriber
  Routing: broadcast to ALL bound queues
end note

Broker -> Client : deliver to subscriber queue\n(FastAPI Bridge → WebSocket → GUI)

note over Client
  Client now knows MyService
  is available with its methods
  and routing_key
end note

== Phase 3: RPC Request / Response ==

Client -> Client : Build request:\nServiceBase.create_request_data(\n  ""svc_api_add"", [3, 5])

Client -> Broker : **publish** to exchange\n**""services_request""** (direct)\nrouting_key = ""service.myservice""\nreply_to = <exclusive callback queue>\ncorrelation_id = <uuid>

note over Broker #fff3e0
  Exchange: **services_request** (direct)
  Queue: **MyService** (non-durable, purged on bind)
  Binding: routing_key = ""service.myservice""
end note

Broker -> Service : deliver to **MyService** queue

Service -> Service : dispatch_request()\nFind svc_api_add()\nCall with args [3, 5]\nBuild ServiceResponse

Service -> Broker : **publish** to exchange\n**""""** (default direct)\nrouting_key = <reply_to queue name>\ncorrelation_id = <same uuid>

note over Broker #f5f5f5
  Exchange: **""** (default direct)
  Routes directly to reply_to queue
  Matched by correlation_id
end note

Broker -> Client : deliver to callback queue

Client -> Client : Match correlation_id\nParse ServiceResponse:\n{ request: ""svc_api_add"",\n  result: ""pass"",\n  result_data: 8 }

== Phase 4: Service Shutdown ==

note over Service
  On shutdown (KeyboardInterrupt
  or svc_api_shutdown RPC)
end note

Service -> Service : unregister_service()\nstop_consuming()

Service -> Broker : **publish** to exchange\n**""service_information""** (topic)\nrouting_key = ""service.information""\nbody = { info: _SERVICE_INFO, state: ""off"" }

Broker -> Registry : deliver to **service_infor_queue**

Registry -> Registry : handle_update()\nRemove service from\nservices_information dict

Registry -> Broker : **publish** to exchange\n**""services_update""** (fanout)\nbody = { updated services\n+ ""__registry_shutdown__"" sentinel }

Broker -> Client : deliver update\n(GUI removes service from list)

== Exchange Summary ==

note over Client, Service
  **Exchanges used:**
  | **Exchange** | **Type** | **Purpose** |
  | ""services_request"" | Direct | RPC calls between services |
  | ""service_information"" | Topic | Registration / unregistration events |
  | ""services_update"" | Fanout | Broadcast service list to UI subscribers |
  | """" (default) | Direct | RPC response routing via reply_to |
end note

@enduml
